WEBVTT

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:38.860
The Price of the Past

00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:38.070
You did well on today's lessons.

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:39.020
Thanks...

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:43.710
Ah, yes. Have you been speaking
with the palace staff lately?

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:49.630
Yeah, sometimes. A little.
About the weather and stuff...

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:52.500
Oh? That is a big step forward.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.380
Couldn't have done it
without you all. Thanks.

00:01:58.790 --> 00:02:02.510
Prince Kai, Professor Heine,
you have a summons from His Majesty.

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:05.170
My. What could it be?

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:09.070
Your Majesty. Prince Bruno,
you are here, too?

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:10.690
What do we have to discuss today?

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:14.940
As well as providing a grooming from
a royal tutor, our kingdom has traditionally

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:18.650
sent its princes to military school
from the age of 15...

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:20.240
until one year ago.

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:21.950
One year ago?

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:25.450
I think you should know about this, too.

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:28.010
This is a tabloid that was
put out this morning.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:36.330
"The palace's taboo topic. The truth behind
the second prince's violent episode."

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:42.010
"One year ago, Prince Kai and Prince Bruno
were enrolled in military school

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:46.060
and used their positions as
royals to lord over it.

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:50.440
They didn't attend classes
or military exercises

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:52.400
and even threatened teachers
into giving them top marks.

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:55.280
Anyone who defied them would
be met with violence.

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:57.230
But the nightmare

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:04.060
was put to an end when Student R was
discovered with major injuries.

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:06.740
Prince Kai was caught
red-handed at the scene,

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:11.250
and his penchant for violence
became known to the public.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:15.870
However, the full extent of the princes'
wicked deeds was still kept hidden.

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:22.110
Prince Kai was formally suspended for the
attack and Prince Bruno took a leave of absence.

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:25.950
Yet the victim, Student R,
was punished with expulsion.

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:29.640
He still suffers under the
pressure of the state's power."

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:31.670
Master, that article is utter nonsense.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:34.250
Yes, I am sure.

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:37.900
I had heard the rumors of Prince
Kai before coming to the palace.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:41.820
But upon meeting him myself,
I concluded that they were false.

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:45.550
If only we could crush
that newspaper company...

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:49.670
Bruno, our citizens have freedom
of thought and speech.

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:53.250
Regardless of the content,
we must protect their speech.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.000
Yes, I know! But...

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:55.830
But...

00:03:56.060 --> 00:04:01.170
It's true that I attacked him...

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:02.670
Kai!

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:04.750
Please don't say it like that!

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.420
You did it for me.

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:09.930
Would you kindly tell me the details?

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:16.400
It was my second year at military school...

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:22.070
Because I look scary... no one came
close to me and I was lonely...

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:25.150
But I was going to school
like normal, no problems...

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:27.450
But Bruno...

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:31.160
Kai, our carriage is here. Let's go home.

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:32.830
Is something wrong?

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:36.460
Ah, just an accident during sword practice.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.600
My sparring partner's sword
hit me with a lot of force.

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:40.290
It looks painful.

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:43.500
Are you already doing battle training?

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:47.830
No, it was only an accident.
He already apologized to me.

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:48.730
Let's go...

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:53.590
It happened the next week, too.

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:56.930
Bruno, that bruise...

00:04:57.200 --> 00:05:02.350
Ah, training again. I swung my
sword with bad timing, that's all.

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:05.980
Bruno, are you having any trouble?

00:05:06.310 --> 00:05:09.980
Not at all. You worry too much, Kai.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:13.400
It happened several times, until one day...

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:16.850
Bruno's late... Where is he?

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:20.610
How long is he going
to bother with the prince?

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:23.250
He said he hasn't had his fill yet.

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:24.920
Whoa. Seriously?

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:31.170
You still need more training, don't you?

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:36.550
I'll toughen you up, you soft royal!

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:38.390
Stop!

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:39.890
How dare you...

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:42.150
How dare you hurt Bruno!

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:45.730
Damn you!

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:46.690
Kai!

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:55.370
Stop, Kai! Please! You'll be...

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:59.190
I'm fine... please... Kai!

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:02.910
Student R and I were both badly injured.

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:07.210
He was expelled, I was suspended...

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.390
But that's not all.

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:15.060
Leonhard and Licht's entrance
to military school was shelved,

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:17.230
and Bruno left, too.

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:19.210
I see.

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:21.880
I'm responsible.

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:23.780
Please, don't say it like that.

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:31.790
I think that Student R, or Ralf von Fuchs,
loathed us for being born into royalty.

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:36.360
So he vented his daily aggrievements
and resentment through violence...

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:42.970
I see. This article hardly lines up
with the facts as you've told them.

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:45.040
That is the problem.

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:48.380
At the time, the police and
the school investigated,

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:52.470
and confirmed Kai and
Bruno's side of things.

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:57.020
I will protect freedom of speech,
but I must correct incorrect facts.

00:06:57.460 --> 00:07:01.160
I have already sent a letter of protest to
the newspaper company and made an announcement.

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:04.270
However, until this is resolved,

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:08.520
you may be subject to hurtful words
from both inside and outside the palace.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.010
I want you to bear with
it for a little while.

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:11.910
Yes, Father.

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:13.810
Understood.

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.910
Royal Tutor, the paper.

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:17.640
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:23.020
"The fallen palace. A criminal
has slipped into the palace."

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:25.910
Royal Tutor.

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:30.210
I have been keeping a close eye on that
since returning from my travels abroad.

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:34.960
I leave my two sons in your hands.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:36.670
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:43.300
Master? Is something the matter?

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:45.420
No, nothing.

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:46.390
Is that so?

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:51.020
At any rate, I can't believe they can write
such tripe and we can do nothing about it...

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:55.100
Bruno, do you know where Fuchs lives?

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:57.340
I am sure we could find out.

00:07:57.570 --> 00:08:00.240
I'm going to try talking to him.

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:01.400
What?!

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:04.530
Most of the article is false...

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:10.150
But they're a paper, so I think they
talked to sources... including Fuchs.

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:15.260
I'm going to ask him if he can have them
correct the parts that aren't true.

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:20.950
That's too rash. He isn't the
sort who would hear us out.

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:22.870
It's wrong to jump to
conclusions about others.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:23.780
Kai...

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:31.050
As princes aiming for the throne,
we have to be willing to talk with anyone...

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:36.490
Professor, I know Father said
to bear it. What do you think?

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.910
I want to meet Fuchs.

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:42.400
Are you certain, Prince Kai?

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:48.160
He may attack you physically
or with insults.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:53.170
It's okay. I won't ever raise
my hand against him again.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:59.880
Very well, then. I will accompany
you as an intermediary.

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:03.300
I will ask His Majesty for
permission to leave the palace.

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:04.730
Professor...

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:07.590
Prince Bruno, please wait here.

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:09.900
If you must go, then take an escort.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.190
It could be dangerous for
only the two of you.

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:15.790
Your wait is over! I, Maximilian, and...

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:16.940
...I, Ludwig...

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:20.700
...swear we will protect Prince Kai
and Professor Heine from harm!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.260
Now, let's be on our way.

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:24.700
They seem exceedingly excited today.

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:29.130
Kai, I'm sorry. This was
my own problem, and now...

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:32.580
No. I'm not doing it just for you.

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:35.880
I'm finally getting along
with the palace staff...

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:40.190
I'd be sad if they avoided me
again because of that article.

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:42.540
So it's for me, too.

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:43.560
Prince Kai!

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:44.660
Prince Kai!

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:49.480
We believe in you, Prince Kai.

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:52.560
We know that you're a gentle soul.

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:57.370
No matter what anyone says,
we'll support Your Highness.

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:59.330
So please...

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:01.220
don't give up!

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:08.750
Thank you.

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:15.880
That was Kai's best smile.
Please don't misinterpret.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:17.800
Y-Yes, of course.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:21.440
His awkwardness is, um,
one of his charms! Right?

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:27.070
Please take good care of Kai, Master.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:33.720
Wow, what a ginormous house!

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.730
This is Herr Fuchs's estate, then?

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:44.750
Prince Kai, Ludwig and I will ask if
they have a place to discuss this.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:48.410
He may still be hostile toward Your Highness.

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:50.420
Please wait in the carriage.

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:51.130
Okay.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:56.760
Herr Fuchs, are you there?

00:10:58.970 --> 00:10:59.760
Who's there?

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:00.920
A little boy?

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:04.130
I-I am a grown man.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:07.760
Please calm down. You can say that later.

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:11.450
Apologies for calling so suddenly.
Are you Herr Fuchs?

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:12.560
Yes...

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:14.890
We are from the palace.

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:16.780
How can I help you?

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:20.770
Prince Kai wishes to speak with you.

00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:24.250
We are not here to attack you.

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:27.030
His Highness has a request regarding
a recent newspaper article.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:31.170
Prince Kai deeply regrets the incident.

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:32.920
Would you please at least hear him out?

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:38.540
Please come in. I'm to blame, too...

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:43.410
Thank you. I will call His Highness.

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.220
What do you know?

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:52.690
I heard he was a wicked brat who
did awful things to Prince Bruno,

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:55.310
but it looks like he's turned a new leaf.

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:58.880
Good thing I won't have to use this...

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:05.980
Huh? Where'd Ludwig go?

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.620
The guard? He went inside already.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:09.780
Oh, okay!

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:13.990
It's been a long time, Your Highness.

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:15.430
Yeah.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:18.180
Please, come in.

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:29.350
It's just as wonderful on the inside, too.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:31.350
Where is your family, if I may?

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:32.850
They're out right now.

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:36.740
Are they? Wait, didn't
Ludwig come in before us?

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:40.100
A servant's showing him to the bathroom.

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:44.630
Here. I suppose you'd prefer
to play in the gardens.

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:47.340
This is my little brother's.
You may play with it.

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:50.850
As I said, I am a grown man and a teacher.

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:52.580
Hmph

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:52.580
Pardon my mistake.

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:52.580
Hmph.

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:55.830
To the matter at hand. The article.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:13:00.240
First, there's something I've
always wanted to ask you.

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:04.310
Why did you hurt Bruno back then?

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:06.850
Actually, there were rumors.

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:07.810
Rumors?

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:12.300
That royals can do anything at military
school and never be punished.

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:15.110
Despite their real grades,
they're made the top of the class.

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:16.680
That's not true.

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:22.350
Prince Bruno did always have top marks,
and I never saw the instructors angry at him.

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:26.600
That's because Bruno is talented
and always on his best behavior.

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:29.090
I didn't have top marks or anything.

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:31.240
I knew that! But...

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:35.420
It's true that you'd received a good enough
education to be at the top, isn't it?

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:39.040
The instructors acted reserved
around Your Highnesses, too.

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:42.920
Several times, they were so careful with
you that they'd lash out at us instead.

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.130
I didn't know...

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:47.790
So my friends and I would vent
about it among ourselves every day,

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:49.560
and it got more and more heated.

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:52.190
I knew it was just jealousy.

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:55.210
I'm ashamed of myself,
looking back on it now.

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:57.630
I won't ask you to forgive me.

00:13:57.630 --> 00:14:02.360
But I truly regret what I did. I'm sorry.

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:07.240
I shouldn't have used violence, either.

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:09.110
Sorry...

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:12.490
Prince Kai... Please, lift your head.

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:14.910
Do you know about this?

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:17.080
The article this teacher mentioned?

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:19.420
Yes. A paper from yesterday.

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:21.540
It has an article about the incident.

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:25.520
What is this? It's all nonsense!

00:14:25.940 --> 00:14:27.540
Wait, last week...

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:31.420
A reporter called on me,
asking about the incident.

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:35.380
I declined them. I had no
idea they'd written this.

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:38.630
I want them to correct the article.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:41.060
I don't want to blame anyone.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:45.900
I just want your help,
so people know the truth.

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:48.150
Okay. I understand.

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:52.900
I'll gladly help you if you'll
allow me, Prince Kai.

00:14:58.300 --> 00:14:59.050
Prince Kai!

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:01.580
Stay where you are!

00:15:02.260 --> 00:15:06.080
Move even a muscle and you'll
lose your precious prince.

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:08.350
Toss them all into the cellar.

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:10.370
If they have any weapons, take them.

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:12.290
Prince Kai!

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:17.900
This one's got something in his pocket, eh?

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:20.140
What's a brat doing with a riding crop?

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:22.820
Huh. I like it. Take them away.

00:15:22.820 --> 00:15:24.180
That is a teacher's pointer,

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:26.150
and I am a grown man.

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:29.350
You take care of the rest.
We're going to drink.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:30.990
Yes, sir.

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:37.280
Wow, there's such a nice,
big storeroom, too...

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:41.170
It really is a fantastic estate.

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:44.430
Sorry. I said I wanted to
talk to him, and now this...

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:47.930
Oh, no, I'd guard Your Highness
wherever it took me!

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:49.640
We have to do something
about these handcuffs.

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:55.500
You were so easy to trick.
What a bunch of fools.

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:59.750
You cannot get away with doing this
to a prince and others from the palace.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:02.780
Hmph. High risk yields high return.

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:07.610
We're going to ask for a ransom of
a million florins for the prince,

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.570
and 1,500 florins for you extras.

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:13.090
1,500 florins! That's five
times my yearly wage!

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:16.330
One million florins is the entire
national budget of a small country.

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:22.400
I'm sure the palace will be willing to
negotiate if we send them a photo of you lot.

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:26.240
The chump change the newspaper
company paid me won't even compare.

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:28.830
Then the article really was...

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:31.440
Of course it was a story I made up.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:36.430
Haughty princes always given special
treatment and taking it for granted...

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:38.430
Isn't a stretch at all, is it?

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:40.880
You...

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:42.290
Prince Kai.

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:47.140
How will you explain this to your
family when they return home?

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:50.360
My family? I don't have a family.

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:51.690
As soon as I was expelled,

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:55.910
they ranted and raved about me being a
worthless disgrace to the family name.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.740
They were so afraid of what their noble
friends would think that they left.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:02.140
Now, smile for the camera.

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:05.710
I can't guarantee your lives
if the ransom isn't paid.

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:08.790
This could be the last photo of you.

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:09.710
Here we go.

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:11.370
Yay!

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:13.370
Damn you! Are you mocking me?!

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:15.900
We've no obligation to be obedient.

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:19.260
I get to be in a photo with
the prince? I'm so happy!

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.220
I've got to brag to the family later.

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:22.380
We're taking another!

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:24.380
What are those faces?

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:26.410
Argh! Again!

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:28.160
Gah!

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:29.610
Then I'll just have to...

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:34.320
I'm under orders not to
damage the valuable goods,

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:37.910
but having him shaking in fear
would be a pretty picture.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.120
Prince Kai!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:41.610
Tch. A poker face, huh?

00:17:43.970 --> 00:17:45.570
Well, what if I do this?

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:49.580
Stop.

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:52.960
You'd hate for this teacher
to be hurt that badly?

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:55.590
Well, now I have to do it!

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:56.580
Stop!

00:17:57.710 --> 00:17:59.550
I said stop, damn you!

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:00.550
Huh?!

00:18:02.210 --> 00:18:03.220
Prince Kai.

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:15.030
I promised the professor...

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:17.490
that I wouldn't use violence again...

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:20.860
For my own good... and everyone else's...

00:18:24.150 --> 00:18:27.750
Then I'll torment you all I like!

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:32.750
The handcuffs? When did you...

00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:38.430
A toy like this is easily
unlocked with a little time.

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.250
You are a poor child.

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:51.650
No one can choose their parents.

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:56.820
But if only you had found a
trustworthy teacher and friends...

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:58.520
Let me go. Damn you!

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:00.280
Do not struggle.

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:03.330
I make it a point to not hurt minors.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:07.640
What's all the noise down here, Fuchs?

00:19:08.220 --> 00:19:09.250
You!

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:13.230
An adult should know better
than to do these things.

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:17.840
It seems that you are in need
of educational guidance.

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:21.500
Let's begin the lesson.

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:22.730
What?

00:19:22.730 --> 00:19:25.780
Maximilian, take care of His Highness.

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:27.650
Yes, sir! This way, Your Highness.

00:19:28.050 --> 00:19:28.930
What about you?

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:30.510
Grab the prince!

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:33.450
Come on, Prince.

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:38.180
Damn it!

00:19:42.150 --> 00:19:44.070
Making fools of us...

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:08.580
Stop!

00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:30.430
Why, you...!

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:36.130
A teacher's pointer is not to be
used in such a savage manner.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.450
You... Who are you?

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:50.980
I am the royal tutor, Heine.

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:57.600
Let this be a lesson to you.

00:21:08.730 --> 00:21:12.180
Prince Kai did his best to stay his hand.

00:21:12.460 --> 00:21:17.130
I certainly can't go beyond
appropriate self-defense.

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:19.430
Be grateful to your prince.

00:21:23.290 --> 00:21:25.490
I didn't get a turn in the spotlight.

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:30.140
Prince! Professor! Are you hurt?!

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:33.230
I was caught by some scoundrels,

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:36.690
but I turned the tables on them and ran to
the palace to call for backup, then came back.

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:37.900
It was a great adventure...

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:40.160
Ahem, now that I'm here, you're safe!

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:42.290
Huh? Wh-What?

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:47.370
Well done, Ludwig. Please see
them handed over to the police.

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:48.900
Huh? Uh, yes, sir.

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:50.310
Stand up!

00:21:50.310 --> 00:21:51.990
Come on. Move.

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:55.570
What are you looking at?

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:59.240
It's not like I'm any worse off now.

00:21:59.240 --> 00:22:01.400
Shut your mouth, you bounder!

00:22:01.940 --> 00:22:02.980
One day...

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:06.010
You should come to the palace.

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:06.830
What?

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:08.500
Huh? Prince Kai?

00:22:08.760 --> 00:22:12.800
You should apply as a palace guard
when you've paid for your crime.

00:22:13.200 --> 00:22:17.390
It would be the best place to put your studies
to use if you're not going into the military...

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:19.880
Prince? What are you saying?

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:21.530
He just held us hostage.

00:22:21.880 --> 00:22:24.440
The stupid-seeming fellow is right.

00:22:24.700 --> 00:22:28.070
Are you saying you'd forgive
me after what I've done?

00:22:28.070 --> 00:22:29.700
S-Stupid?

00:22:29.700 --> 00:22:32.000
No. I can't forgive you.

00:22:32.000 --> 00:22:37.320
But I think everyone has the right
to start over again if they want to.

00:22:37.870 --> 00:22:41.540
As a candidate for the throne of Glanzreich,

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:44.710
that's how I think our kingdom should be.

00:22:49.200 --> 00:22:50.890
May I ask one thing?

00:22:50.890 --> 00:22:52.300
When you were in military school,

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:55.980
from whom did you hear the negative
rumors about the princes?

00:22:56.650 --> 00:22:59.680
A friend of my parents, probably.

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:01.470
I don't remember.

00:23:01.720 --> 00:23:02.750
Take me away.

00:23:06.460 --> 00:23:09.730
That was excellent, Prince Kai.

00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:19.810
With this, the bad rumors about
the princes should clear up.

00:23:23.010 --> 00:23:24.930
Count Rosenberg.

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:33.040
There's something I'd like
to ask you about your past.

00:23:34.310 --> 00:23:37.760
Won't you have a little chat with me?

00:23:39.690 --> 00:23:42.880
Master is strong, but Leonhard's
fencing is quite good, too.

00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:44.720
I hear you bested everyone
in the recent sparring.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:46.250
Oh, it wasn't that special.

00:23:46.250 --> 00:23:49.900
I just went swoosh, whoosh, swoosh
with my sword and got points easily.

00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:53.770
Next Time:
The Professor I Don't Know

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:51.680
Next time, "The Professor I Don't Know."

00:23:51.680 --> 00:23:53.950
This is a man of instinct. Incredible.
